# Bake Lady Conventions

- **Workspace root**: `/Users/jacobusbrink/Code/projects/bake-lady`
- **Stack**: Vite + TypeScript (strict) + Preact + vanilla CSS
- **Persistence**: localStorage (JSON blob)
- **Build output**: single `index.html` via vite-plugin-singlefile

## Key directories

| Directory              | Purpose                              |
|------------------------|--------------------------------------|
| `src/components/`      | Preact UI components                 |
| `src/store/`           | State management + localStorage I/O  |
| `src/lib/`             | Pure utilities (scaling, search, etc)|
| `src/types/`           | Shared TypeScript types              |
| `src/styles/`          | CSS (base, components, print)        |
| `docs/`                | Specs, architecture, build plan      |

## Rules

- TypeScript strict — no `any`, no `ts-ignore`
- Components never touch `localStorage` directly — always through `store/`
- Mobile-first responsive (375px+ minimum)
- Print layout is a first-class concern — never break it
- `npm run build` must produce a standalone `index.html`
- Conventional commits: `feat:`, `fix:`, `chore:`, `docs:`, `test:`, `refactor:`
- UI: warm, characterful, classic recipe-book feel — not corporate
- Keep bundle tiny — every dependency inlines into the single HTML file
